[size=5][b][color=#E8C88A]Health Regen - Configurable[/color][/b][/size]

Human and vampire health regeneration in one configurable mod. Choose separate rates for each form, keep regeneration outside combat, or allow it during combat. Both forms default to 1.5% per second.

[size=4][b][color=#E8C88A]Stops healing at the limit[/color][/b][/size]

Regeneration stops when your health bar or current vampire segment is full. This avoids the original vampire mod's repeated healing attempts at the limit.

[size=4][b][color=#E8C88A]Configuration[/color][/b][/size]

Choose your settings in [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thebloodofdawnwalker/mods/271]Mod Setting Menu[/url], then press Apply to save and update gameplay.
[list]
[*][b][color=#A8D5C2]Human regeneration:[/color][/b] 0% to 5% per second; default 1.5%.
[*][b][color=#A8D5C2]Vampire regeneration:[/color][/b] 0% to 5% per second; default 1.5%.
[*][b][color=#A8D5C2]Combat regeneration:[/color][/b] Off by default. Off means outside combat only; On also allows combat regeneration.
[*][b][color=#A8D5C2]Restore vampire segments:[/color][/b] Off by default. On allows regeneration to restore lost segments toward full health.
[*][b][color=#A8D5C2]Logging:[/color][/b] Off by default; writes to UE4SS.log when enabled.
[/list][color=#E6B980]Zero disables this mod's added regeneration for the selected form.[/color] Existing game regeneration bonuses remain separate. Regeneration does not revive a dead player.

[size=3][b][color=#A8D5C2]Manual configuration[/color][/b][/size]

Launch the game once to create settings.ini, then close it. Open this file inside your The Blood of Dawnwalker game folder:
[code]Dawnwalker\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods\HealthRegeneration\settings.ini[/code]The default settings are:
[code][Settings]
vampireRegenPercent = 1.5
humanRegenPercent = 1.5
combatRegen = 0
restoreVampireSegments = 0
debugLogging = 0[/code]Change either regeneration rate using the steps above; 1.5 means 1.5% per second. For combatRegen, restoreVampireSegments and debugLogging, use 0 for Off or 1 for On. Save the file, restart the game and load a save to apply your changes.

[size=4][b][color=#E8C88A]Installation[/color][/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b][color=#A8D5C2]Vortex:[/color][/b] Install Health-Regen-Configurable.zip through Vortex, enable it and deploy.
[*][b][color=#A8D5C2]Manual:[/color][/b] Copy the archive's Dawnwalker folder into your The Blood of Dawnwalker game folder, preserving the folder structure.
[/list]
[size=4][b][color=#E8C88A]Credits and source[/color][/b][/size]

